{"page":75,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:187","surah":3,"ayah":187,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ أَخَذَ ٱللَّهُ مِيثَـٰقَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوا۟ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ لَتُبَيِّنُنَّهُۥ لِلنَّاسِ وَلَا تَكْتُمُونَهُۥ فَنَبَذُوهُ وَرَآءَ ظُهُورِهِمْ وَٱشْتَرَوْا۟ بِهِۦ ثَمَنًا قَلِيلًا ۖ فَبِئْسَ مَا يَشْتَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God took a pledge from those who were given the Scripture- ‘Make it known to people; do not conceal it’- but they tossed the pledge over their shoulders, they bartered it for a small price: what a bad bargain they made!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَخَذَ","en_gloss":"took","transliteration":"akhadha","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِيثَـٰقَ","en_gloss":"a Covenant","transliteration":"mīthāqa","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(from) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أُوتُوا۟","en_gloss":"were given","transliteration":"ūtū","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَتُبَيِّنُنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"You certainly make it clear","transliteration":"latubayyinunnahu","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"to the mankind","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَكْتُمُونَهُۥ","en_gloss":"conceal it","transliteration":"taktumūnahu","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَنَبَذُوهُ","en_gloss":"Then they threw it","transliteration":"fanabadhūhu","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَرَآءَ","en_gloss":"behind","transliteration":"warāa","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ظُهُورِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their backs","transliteration":"ẓuhūrihim","verse_key":"3:187"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱشْتَرَوْ