{"pos":12,"ar":"١٩٠","en_gloss":"(190)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:190"}]},{"verse_key":"3:191","surah":3,"ayah":191,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ يَذْكُرُونَ ٱللَّهَ قِيَـٰمًا وَقُعُودًا وَعَلَىٰ جُنُوبِهِمْ وَيَتَفَكَّرُونَ فِى خَلْقِ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ رَبَّنَا مَا خَلَقْتَ هَـٰذَا بَـٰطِلًا سُبْحَـٰنَكَ فَقِنَا عَذَابَ ٱلنَّارِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"who remember God standing, sitting, and lying down, who reflect on the creation of the heavens and earth: ‘Our Lord! You have not created all this without purpose- You are far above that!- so protect us from the torment of the Fire.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَذْكُرُونَ","en_gloss":"remember","transliteration":"yadhkurūna","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قِيَـٰمًۭا","en_gloss":"standing","transliteration":"qiyāman","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَقُعُودًۭا","en_gloss":"and sitting","transliteration":"waquʿūdan","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَعَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"and on","transliteration":"waʿalā","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جُنُوبِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their sides","transliteration":"junūbihim","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَيَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"and they reflect","transliteration":"wayatafakkarūna","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَلْقِ","en_gloss":"(the) creation","transliteration":"khalqi","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَبَّنَا","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"3:191"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":